{% if page.handle == 'founder-story' %}
  {{ 'chaver-founder-story.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<section class="founder-story-page section">
  <div class="page-width">
    <header class="founder-story-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">CHAVÉR / FOUNDER STORY</div>
      <h1>BUILT WITH PATIENCE.<br>DRIVEN BY FREEDOM.</h1>
      <div class="founder-story-intro-copy">
        <p>CHAVÉR is more than clothing. It is the story of starting before everything is figured out, building with ambition and creating a community for people who want more out of life.</p>
        <p>Three chapters about where it started, the struggle behind the process and the movement I am building for the future.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="founder-story-chapters">
      <article class="founder-story-chapter">
        <div class="founder-story-marker"><span>THE FOUNDER STORY</span><span>CHAVÉR / OUR STORY</span></div>
        <div class="founder-story-layout">
          <figure class="founder-story-photo founder-story-photo-single">
            <img src="{{ 'chaver-founder-origin-editorial.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Folded dark T-shirt, fabric swatches and a sketchbook on a sunlit table" width="1122" height="1402" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
          <div class="founder-story-copy">
            <h2>WHERE IT<br>STARTED.</h2>
            <div class="founder-story-text">
              <p>It all began with one thing: an obsession with clothing. I’ve been deep into fashion for years. Not because looking good every single day matters to me. But the more I looked around, the more I realized something was missing.</p>
              <p>I missed a brand that was more than clothing. A brand for people who want more. Who want to look different, who aim for a certain standard. People with ambition. People who want to build something of their own. Who choose their own path. Who refuse to blend in with the rest.</p>
              <p>This idea for my brand came to life in November 2025, but honestly, the dream started years before that. I just never took the lead to start. Until now. This time, I’m all in.</p>
              <p>And I also want to motivate young entrepreneurs through my own brand. To make something out of nothing, something other people can learn from. The community of Chavér is about motivation, inspiration, and doing what you love to do.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="founder-story-chapter">
        <div class="founder-story-marker"><span>THE FOUNDER STORY</span><span>CHAVÉR / OUR STORY</span></div>
        <div class="founder-story-layout">
          <figure class="founder-story-photo founder-story-photo-single">
            <img src="{{ 'chaver-founder-process-editorial.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Hands checking a garment seam at a softly lit worktable" width="1122" height="1402" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
          <div class="founder-story-copy">
            <h2>THE STRUGGLE.<br>THE PROCESS.</h2>
            <div class="founder-story-text">
              <p>Nothing comes easy, and that’s exactly how it should be. I’ve faced a lot of obstacles. I listened too much to people who would never dare to do what I wanted to do. I was surrounded by people who didn’t talk about entrepreneurship, so I couldn’t easily speak about my dreams. And I had no idea where to begin.</p>
              <p>But one thing I learned: you don’t need to know everything to start. You start to learn.</p>
              <p>The fashion world is tough. You need to be unique, have a strong vision, and never quit.</p>
              <p>And yes, I work full-time while building this brand to finance everything. Sometimes the late nights behind the laptop became too much, but I found my way.</p>
              <p>Step by step.<br>Closer every day. Never stopping.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="founder-story-chapter">
        <div class="founder-story-marker"><span>THE FOUNDER STORY</span><span>CHAVÉR / OUR STORY</span></div>
        <div class="founder-story-layout">
          <figure class="founder-story-photo founder-story-photo-single">
            <img src="{{ 'chaver-founder-future-editorial.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Two men walking through a sunlit stone courtyard" width="1122" height="1402" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
          <div class="founder-story-copy">
            <h2>THE FUTURE.<br>THE MOVEMENT.</h2>
            <div class="founder-story-text">
              <p>My brand is more than clothing. It’s a community.<br>No big logos. No loud designs.<br>But subtle, clean, modern pieces.<br>That’s the future, and that’s what I’m building.</p>
              <p>I want to create a brand that connects people. A movement for those who want more out of life, the ones who were stuck with their dreams, afraid to share them because others judged or doubted them… people who were surrounded by opinions from those who would never achieve what they want.</p>
              <p>And yes, one day I want a headquarters, a team with the same purpose, and a reach that goes worldwide.</p>
              <p>But everything starts here.<br>My message to you: if you want something, go for it.<br>Make a plan. Don’t let anyone tell you that you can’t.</p>
              <p>I’ve missed many opportunities by holding back. Not anymore.<br>Show them what you’re made of.<br>Because at the end of the day…</p>
              <p><strong>the best revenge is<br>success in your life</strong></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="founder-story-closing">
    <div class="page-width founder-story-closing-inner">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">THE FIRST CHAPTER</div>
        <h2>FOUNDATIONS<br>COLLECTION.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-story-closing-copy">
        <p>Timeless essentials made with patience and purpose. Ordering opens only when every piece is ready.</p>
        <div class="founder-story-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">EXPLORE FOUNDATIONS</a>
          <button class="btn btn-solid" type="button" data-newsletter-trigger>JOIN FOR EARLY ACCESS</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>

{% else %}
  <section class="section"><div class="page-width"><div class="eyebrow">CHAVÉR</div><h1 class="section-title">{{ page.title }}</h1><div class="rte">{{ page.content }}</div></div></section>
{% endif %}
{% schema %}{"name":"Main page","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
